{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lootbane is a roguelite, hack-and-slash, autobattler built around one thing: <strong>Loot</strong>. You choose your hero at the start, only that hero can equip the gear. Followers you recruit or find in your adventure give bonuses and change how fights play out. Explore changing regions: peaceful grasslands, wild steppes, hot sand dunes, and the smoking approach to an abandoned volcanic castle. Every run tells a new story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/88bd09a630a7d0a28b7665e2a3ee6d7f.poster.avif?t=1758021042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/88bd09a630a7d0a28b7665e2a3ee6d7f.webm?t=1758021042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/88bd09a630a7d0a28b7665e2a3ee6d7f.mp4?t=1758021042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your path, your fortune</strong><br>On each turn you pick one of three paths. Fight monsters for rare gear, visit a mystery merchant, trade in town, recruit a helpful follower, or stumble into cursed ruins. The same choice system runs in the dungeons. Paths hide risks and rewards, sometimes the safe road gives nothing, and the dangerous shortcut holds a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/e992abd7f7c718664ecc7c7860500612.poster.avif?t=1758021042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/e992abd7f7c718664ecc7c7860500612.webm?t=1758021042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/e992abd7f7c718664ecc7c7860500612.mp4?t=1758021042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons are a risk</strong><br>Dungeons work like the overworld: one of three options every room. Rooms can be combat, traps, treasure, healing, bosses, or surprises. At the end of the run, you must decide: take what you found and go home, or descend deeper. Each deeper level multiplies your gold and chance for legendary loot, but enemies get stronger, and if you fail you lose the run\u2019s loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/e43fb950bc82451b985e37ddbe1a0f12.poster.avif?t=1758021042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/e43fb950bc82451b985e37ddbe1a0f12.webm?t=1758021042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/e43fb950bc82451b985e37ddbe1a0f12.mp4?t=1758021042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple rules, deep choices</strong><br>Items are randomized. You only see full item stats after you finish a dungeon run or after clearing a combat encounter, so each choice feels tense. Followers offer passive bonuses, grant abilities, or add active spells. Your job is to plan the path, pick the best bonuses, and create strong synergies with your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong><br>Auto battles let you focus on strategy, not fast clicks. Play short runs for quick sessions or dive deep for big rewards. Experiment with builds, hunt perfect synergies, and unlock new heroes and upgrades that change every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risks. Build a legend or lose it all.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950440?t=1758021042","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/563ec58048d59f0056aabd69d12a5f9cd02bcb67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758021042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/8daa10fabf04d8ec85f0efd06cec0e5be07e22b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758021042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/8daa10fabf04d8ec85f0efd06cec0e5be07e22b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758021042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lootbane is a roguelite, hack-and-slash, autobattler built around one thing: <strong>Loot</strong>. You choose your hero at the start, only that hero can equip the gear. Followers you recruit or find in your adventure give bonuses and change how fights play out. Explore changing regions: peaceful grasslands, wild steppes, hot sand dunes, and the smoking approach to an abandoned volcanic castle. Every run tells a new story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/88bd09a630a7d0a28b7665e2a3ee6d7f.poster.avif?t=1758021042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.